{"fields":[{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasIntroAudio"},{"t":"A","v":"intro","n":"IntroAudio","s":"If an apple a day keeps the doctor away, what do 8 vegetables keep away? Bears, probably."},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasPromptAudio"},{"t":"A","v":"prompt","n":"PromptAudio","s":"Quels sont les ingrédients du cassoulet de Castelnaudary ?"},{"t":"B","v":"false","n":"HasClueAudio0"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_0_hint","n":"ClueAudio0"},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio1"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_1_hint","n":"ClueAudio1","s":"Orange you glad this orange vegetable is in there?"},{"t":"B","v":"false","n":"HasClueAudio2"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_2_hint","n":"ClueAudio2"},{"t":"B","v":"false","n":"HasClueAudio3"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_3_hint","n":"ClueAudio3"},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio4"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_4_hint","n":"ClueAudio4","s":"V8 contains this common herb, and not too sparsely."},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio5"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_5_hint","n":"ClueAudio5","s":"Lettuce be clear: I will not leaf you hanging! That was a hint."},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio6"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_6_hint","n":"ClueAudio6","s":"Did you know watercress is in V8? It's true. Type \"watercress\"."},{"t":"B","v":"true","n":"HasClueAudio7"},{"t":"A","v":"answers_7_hint","n":"ClueAudio7","s":"Every can of V8 includes a little bit of Popeye's favorite vegetable."},{"t":"B","v":"false","n":"HasFollowupAudio"},{"t":"A","v":"followup","n":"FollowupAudio"},{"t":"B","v":"false","n":"HasOutroAudio"},{"t":"A","v":"outro","n":"OutroAudio"}]}
